  ["Phase 3\nWeeks 5 to 6", "Revenue", "Consultation Conversion, Membership Enrollment, Lead Follow Up, Review Generation", "With a full, consistent schedule, install the systems that grow revenue and lifetime value."],
  ["Phase 4\nWeeks 7 to 8", "Operations depth", "Treatment Protocols, Payment and Reconciliation, Inventory, Onboarding", "Finish by deepening the back of house so the gains hold and the next hire scales cleanly."]
