      "Present the membership as the lowest cost way for the client to reach their goal.",
      "Explain benefits, included services, and member pricing clearly.",
      "Enroll on the spot, set up recurring billing, and record the start date.",
      "Welcome the new member and schedule the first member visit.",
      "Review member usage monthly to prevent lapse and prompt upgrades."
    ],
    implement: "Load tiers and billing into the CRM, build a one page member benefits sheet, and set a lapse watch report.",
    train: "Teach the tier match and the benefit framing, and track enrollment rate by team member."
  },
  {
    id: "C3", title: "Review Generation and Reputation Management",
    purpose: "Build a steady flow of positive reviews and respond to all feedback professionally.",
