r1.push(P("The figures are illustrative, but the lesson is real. Moving from five percent to fifteen percent on a million dollar practice adds roughly fifty thousand dollars in gross profit from clients who are already walking through your door.", { before: 100, after: 60 }));

r1.push(H2("Why the Money Sits on the Shelf"));
r1.push(P("If retail is this profitable, why do most practices barely touch it. The reasons are consistent.", { after: 80 }));
[
  "Clinicians do not see themselves as sellers, so the recommendation never happens.",
  "There is no system, no target, and no accountability, so retail depends on luck.",
