r1.push(P("Every one of these is a system problem, and every one is fixable. The rest of this module builds the systems that solve them.", { before: 60, after: 60 }));

r1.push(H1("Part Two. Building the Retail Engine"));
r1.push(P("Six systems turn retail from luck into a repeatable stream. Build them in order.", { after: 80 }));

r1.push(H2("System 1. Curate a Tight, Protocol Linked Assortment"));
[
  "Sell what supports your services. Every homecare product should extend or protect the result of a treatment you provide.",
  "Keep the assortment tight. A focused set of hero products and simple regimens outsells a crowded shelf, because confusion does not convert.",
  "Carry professional lines with diversion control, products a client cannot simply reorder cheaper online. This protects both your margin and the reason to buy from you.",
  "Link every protocol to a homecare regimen, so each treatment has a defined product prescription waiting at checkout."
