r1.push(H2("System 2. Price for Margin and Brand Integrity"));
[
  "Hold the recommended retail price. Discounting professional lines erodes margin and signals that the products are not essential.",
  "Build regimens, not single units. A three step regimen raises the average retail ticket and improves the client result.",
  "Use membership to drive retail. Member product pricing or an included product each month turns retail into a reason to join and a reason to stay."
].forEach(t => r1.push(bullet(t)));

r1.push(H2("System 3. Merchandise Like a Premium Retailer"));
[
  "Bring products into the light. Visible, well lit, clean displays with testers convert far better than a locked cabinet behind the desk.",
  "Place product at three points. The treatment room where the result is discussed, the consultation room where the plan is built, and the front desk for the final attachment.",
  "Match the presentation to your price point. A premium spa with premium pricing needs a premium display to match."
