  ["Retail gross margin", "The profit the program actually keeps", "Commonly 40 to 60 percent"],
  ["Retail revenue per provider", "Who prescribes and who needs coaching", "Compare across the team"],
  ["Dead and expired stock percent", "Margin lost to waste", "Keep low, review monthly"]
], [3000, 3680, 2680]));
r1.push(note("Start by leading with two metrics, attachment rate and average retail per visit. They are the most coachable, and improving them moves every other number on the list."));

r1.push(H1("Part Four. The Implementation Roadmap and Tracker"));
r1.push(P("Build the program in four short phases over roughly four to six weeks. Fix the foundation first, then make it visible, then make it routine, then measure it.", { after: 120 }));
r1.push(new Table({ width: { size: 9360, type: WidthType.DXA }, columnWidths: [1500, 2200, 5660],
  rows: [
    ["Phase", "Focus", "What to do"],
