c.push(H1("Part Four. Real Numbers and Sample Plans"));
c.push(P("Principles only matter when they touch a real paycheck. This section turns the rules into dollars. The figures are illustrative. Replace them with your own service prices and product costs.", { after: 120 }));

c.push(H2("The Margin Trap, in Real Numbers"));
c.push(P("Consider an injector who produces forty thousand dollars in a month, on a service mix where product costs run about thirty five percent of revenue. The table compares the revenue based plan that traps so many practices with a margin protected plan on the same production.", { after: 120 }));
