c.push(P("Why this works. It is transparent, it is modeled on the person's real production rather than a guess, it frames the change around the health of the practice and the provider's future rather than a takeaway, it pays for behaviors the provider is already doing, and it gives a one page summary and a transition window so the person never feels cornered.", { before: 60, after: 100 }));
