c.push(P("Your next step. Before you change anyone's pay, run the Phase 1 audit and model your top provider's last three months under a margin protected plan, exactly as shown for Maria. Once the numbers are on one page, the right structure, and the right conversation, become clear. Pay for profit, not just production, and put every plan in writing.", { before: 160, after: 60 }));

